{"v":1,"built_at":"2026-10-23T17:11:26.444Z","core":{"appSha":"c54f9dd2c0d3","builtAt":"2026-10-23T12:12:58.106Z","schemaV":1},"key":"us/119-hr-4467","model":{"found":true,"billKey":"us/119-hr-4467","polity":"us","eyebrow":"United States","reference":"H.R. 4467","title":"Vicksburg National Military Park Boundary Modification Act","titleExpandable":false,"meta":"Natural Resources Committee · Rep. Bennie Thompson (D-MS)","summary":{"lead":"Official summary (Congressional Research Service, Reported to House): ","blocks":[{"kind":"para","text":"Vicksburg National Military Park Boundary Modification Act","gap":"none"},{"kind":"para","text":"This bill directs the Department of the Interior to convey approximately 7 acres of specified land (in two parcels) within the Vicksburg National Military Park to Mississippi for an interpretive center.","gap":"para"},{"kind":"para","text":"The conveyed land must facilitate public access to the park, may not be used in a manner that adversely impacts the park's resources or visitor experience, and remains subject to any use restriction that Interior determines is appropriate.","gap":"para"},{"kind":"para","text":"Interior must convey the land by quitclaim deed and without consideration, such as payment. Upon the conveyance of the land, Interior must modify the park's boundary to exclude the land.","gap":"para"}]},"pathLabel":"The legislative path","latest":{"labelText":"Signed by Pres. Trump","glyph":{"icon":"scroll","badge":true},"date":"20 October 2026"},"asOf":{"lead":"Record as of ","date":"20 October 2026","note":"the most recent action in the official record. Status can lag; each step below carries its own date."},"groups":[{"spine":{"key":"rec-H.R. 4467-20","kind":"record","spine":true,"date":"20 October 2026","labelText":"Signed by Pres. Trump","glyph":{"icon":"scroll","badge":true},"postId":"us-20261021-2b880b04","postHref":"/p/us-20261021-2b880b04","whatsNext":{"lead":"What's next: ","text":"Takes effect (on enactment unless